data: {"id": "ce6880c6e7024211-final", "run_id": "ce6880c6e7024211", "seq": 1126, "ts_ms": 1788775618825, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p` | CreateContainerConfigError | Pod aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p 处于 Pending 状态，容器 app 因 CreateContainerConfigError 无法启动 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes (fact-7a1d030e27bd) | `Warning Failed Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input` | 明确指向配置缺失的致命错误，是容器无法启动的直接原因 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes (fact-dd92fe8fe1d7) | Pod `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p` 状态为 `Pending` | 确认 Pod 当前不可用且处于等待阶段 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes (fact-a81cfe31e3bf) | 容器 `app` 的 `restart_count` 为 0 | 表明容器从未成功启动，排除了运行后崩溃或健康检查失败的可能 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus (fact-9b5d14cdfb6a) | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (app) = 1, reason=`CreateContainerConfigError` | 从监控指标层面确认了容器处于“配置错误等待”状态 |\n| 5 | K8s Config | kubernetes (fact-2fa3488b6fe5, fact-38a3d3a0f441) | 资源 Request: CPU 5m, Memory 8Mi | 提供资源需求上下文，非故障成因 |\n\n证据间互相印证：K8s Event (证据1) 明确指出了缺失的具体 Secret Key，这与 K8s State (证据3) 中重启次数为 0 的现象一致，说明 Pod 卡在启动初始化阶段。Metric (证据4) 进一步从指标维度确认了 `CreateContainerConfigError` 状态，与 Event 的致命错误信息形成闭环。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod spec 引用了 Secret 'aiops-case-04/workload-input' 中不存在的 key 'unavailable-key' → kubelet 在容器启动时注入配置失败 → 容器启动失败，状态转为 Waiting (Reason: CreateContainerConfigError) → Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态，无日志产出\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：Pod 配置错误。Pod 规范中引用了 Secret `aiops-case-04/workload-input` 中的 `unavailable-key`，但该 key 在 Secret 中不存在。\n此配置错误导致 kubelet 在创建容器前无法注入所需的环境变量或卷数据，直接触发了 `CreateContainerConfigError`，致使容器无法启动（证据编号：1, 4, 3）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 56.1s\n├─ 问题定位: 19.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 27.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p: 27.4s (Evidence 21.0s, RCA 6.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 56.099, "metrics": {"run_id": "ce6880c6e7024211", "mttr": {"value": "56.1s", "seconds": 56.10428333282471, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "57%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.95, "weighted_score": 0.19, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 95%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 56104.28333282471, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 52052.20103263855, "tool_calls": 8, "executed_tool_calls": 8, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 8, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 10140.336036682129, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3733.5426807403564}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定